Ours (dsv41 recipe), Apache-2.0, against vLLM main 6e517b15 + patches 0001-0007.
DSpark top-k Markov bias for DeepSeek-V4.1: speculative-config `dspark_draft_topk` (vLLM's existing path for Qwen3 DSpark)
now accepts the V4.1 drafter (DSparkV41DraftModel), and DSparkDeepseekV4ForCausalLM gains apply_markov_bias_gathered,
delegating to the shared DSparkMarkovHead.apply_bias_gathered. V4.1's markov_w2 is a replicated 129,280 x 256 BF16
projection read once per draft position on every rank (GB10 TP=2 trace: 5 calls x 262 us = 1.38 ms per decode step at
DSpark 5); with dspark_draft_topk=K the bias is applied to the K best base-logit candidates only (K gathered rows).
Opt-in; drafts can differ from the full-vocab argmax when the true argmax is outside the base top-K, which only
moves acceptance (verification is unchanged). Test: patches/tests/test_dspark_topk_markov.py.

